    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41761" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐποικ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>settle in a colony,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς πόλεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					1.96
				</span></i>
			, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be built ṇear,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεῖχος ἐπὶ τῇ Σαλώνῃ -ισμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					56.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτειχίζω, τινί</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				4.26.6
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				28.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>bring into cultivation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔδωκεν.. γῆν ψιλὴν ἀγρὸν ἐποικίσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					302
				</span></i>
			 (Gambreum, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>).</div>
